   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Looks like there isn&#39;t much activity here but I thought I&#39;d try: <div><br></div><div><b>How can I get the relevant &quot;files from the CHILDES archive&quot; (the Brown corpus) that p. 22 of the book (2nd edition) instructs me to get? </b></div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m okay with being unable to get the three sets of files/data mentioned below that, on the same page (since they&#39;re used for &quot;just one assignment each&quot;), but it sounds like the Brown corpus and BNC are something readers should have as they work through the book. The book says to go to <a href=\"http://childes.psy.cmu.edu/data/Eng-NA-MOR/Brown.zip\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://childes.psy.cmu.edu/data/Eng-NA-MOR/Brown.zip&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491169630000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0kHcT3a0ayUywxnqGAAT-U\">childes.psy.cmu.edu/data/Eng-NA-MOR/Brown.zip</a>, but that link hasn&#39;t worked for a long time. I found what appears to be the equivalent at <a href=\"https://childes.talkbank.org/access/Eng-NA/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://childes.talkbank.org/access/Eng-NA/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792491169630000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Vnph7s5Xd6l4C8Runea8b\">https://childes.talkbank.org/access/Eng-NA/</a>, but the only way to get the files is to download them one at at time. I&#39;m fine with doing that but, if I do, <b>is there anything further that I&#39;d need to do in order to use them successfully for the book exercises that involve them?</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div>Thanks to whoever can help,</div><div><br></div><div>-Jori</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
